<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off mostly $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off mostly $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 Lower. Demand was light to moderate on a moderate movement. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  51.00-52.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  44.50-51.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  40.50-44.50</p>
<p>Sows - firm/up $1.00. Top $53.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 42.00-45.50 Few 41.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 45.00-47.50</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 47.50-52.50 Few 53.50 over 650 lbs.</p>
</text>
